scn 1
# perf follow-up J: refreshPlane clustering workload, 4 blobs x 1 toggling churn lines
# (tools/clusterchurn_scn.py). Movers of footprint 1, 2, 3 keep three Legion planes in use.
name clusterchurn-small
ticks 600
seed 11
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
map flat 512 512
type a mover 1 2500 10 1.8
type b mover 2 2500 10 1.8
type c mover 3 2500 10 1.6
group A 0 a 12 rect 20 20 44 32
group B 0 b 12 rect 20 40 50 52
group C 0 c 12 rect 20 60 60 76
churn 158 399 2 2 every=1 toggle from=0
churn 107 223 2 2 every=1 toggle from=0
churn 479 320 2 2 every=1 toggle from=0
churn 346 426 2 2 every=1 toggle from=1
at 1 move A 480 470
at 1 move B 470 480
at 1 move C 460 460
at 300 move A 30 30
at 300 move B 40 30
at 300 move C 30 40
